# Required environment variable NAMES for site-2 (Signature MVP).
# Values live in /srv/chungdoi-site2/.env on the VPS only — never in source.
# Payment reconciliation, trial reminders and production email stay DISABLED
# for site-2 until callbacks/credentials/data policy are approved, so no
# payment or email credential names are listed here on purpose.

# --- build input (baked into the image; must be the site-2 HTTPS origin) ---
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL

# --- runtime ---
DATABASE_URL
SESSION_SECRET

# --- optional display-only integration ---
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY
